REQUIRE_FILES:
  - When modifying ANY code/resource/config, show all files containing:
    - Direct references or imports
    - Dependent code paths and usages
    - Infrastructure dependencies
    - Configuration dependencies
    - Test coverage
    - Deployment paths

REQUIRE_COMPLETE_FILES:
  - For ANY code changes
  - For infrastructure changes
  - For shared code/utilities
  - For configuration changes
  - For dependency changes
  - For API/interface changes

VERIFY_BEFORE_CHANGES:
  - All references and usages found
  - All dependencies identified
  - All configurations aligned
  - All tests affected
  - All deployments impacted
  - All security implications checked

BLOCK_UNTIL:
  - All dependent files are shown
  - All usages are understood
  - All impacts are traced
  - Existing behavior is understood
  - Changes are fully scoped 